(post_point [6.953] in the GiD mesh, as the Professional 02-08-2026: one
 Point mesh PostPoint, one node per active post point numbered after the
 highest node [7 8 9], one Point element per node numbered after the
 highest element [3 4 5], material 1000 plus the post_point index
 [1000 1003 1005]. The post point 5 lies outside the mesh and is written
 too. build_safe.sh runs it in a scratch copy and checks the .flavia.msh.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0 0
node 2  1 0
node 3  1 1
node 4  0 1
node 5  2 0
node 6  2 1
element 1  -quad4 1 2 4 3
element 2  -quad4 2 5 3 6
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.2
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
bounda_dof 0  1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1  4 -velx
post_point 0 0.25 0.5
post_point 3 1.75 0.75
post_point 5 7. 8.
control_timestep 20 1. 1.
control_print_gid 20 -yes
end_data
